# Internal files, not served (user, 3 Nov 2026, message 683 (g); TODO 14jy (a)). The site serves only what index.html, its panels
# and gridtwin-3d/ read, plus LICENSE and README.md (the page links both). A deny list with no '!' lines: each line removes files,
# none adds any back. A file the page starts to read is served with no change here; a new internal file is served until a line
# here covers it. Wrangler matches these lines without regard to case ('ESK*' would also hide nodal/eskom_tariff_components.json).

# Folders the page never reads
/harness/
/docs/
/validation/
/scripts/
/.github/
.DS_Store
